Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.59,0:01:54.26,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\bord2.3\be5\1vc(&HF5ACA5&,&HF5ACA5&,&HF6C0EA&,&HF6C0EA&)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H0A&}口渴难耐也绝不后悔
